Name: jmap_emailpush
Type: SWITCH
Default-Value: 0
Last-Modified: UNRELEASED

If enabled, support JMAP email delivery push notifications
(draft-ietf-jmap-emailpush) in the user's own account.  Cyrus evaluates each
PushSubscription's filter when a message is delivered, and reports the matches
as an EmailPush event; the notification service that handles
PushSubscriptionCreated events must send the pushes.
